   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Tavernel Grid complied with each of its covenants on its Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026, and the compliance certificate agrees with the bank's calculations in each case. The most important change is a steady decline in Minimum Unrestricted Cash headroom since August. Cash now stands at {{fact:babfaa0c-ec08-429f-8055-ec6bc6e11692}} against a {{fact:88f34b53-998a-4771-8672-2e6c09998c39}} floor, a cushion of {{fact:8be6e746-dc43-4b96-aecc-08d235db6b5b}}. No open work items await a decision this period.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was calculated at {{fact:4502bcb8-0217-451e-a1f3-19280fb1daec}} against a required {{fact:bdac9e1a-358b-4490-91e3-800e6e3bffba}}, a cushion of {{fact:ac63132f-5655-4b76-8f6b-00dcb51c1db0}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was {{fact:babfaa0c-ec08-429f-8055-ec6bc6e11692}} against {{fact:88f34b53-998a-4771-8672-2e6c09998c39}} required, a cushion of {{fact:8be6e746-dc43-4b96-aecc-08d235db6b5b}}. Revenue to Plan was {{fact:442f16be-a50d-45ce-bd68-1b92f3bf5bee}} against a {{fact:fe18f623-95a9-4579-ad42-444fe67aed32}} minimum, a cushion of {{fact:cb16809d-b762-499d-9bf6-cf6b3afbf507}}. Each covenant is compliant. The certificate reports runway of {{fact:8a5a0505-7837-4aec-b715-f332fb25c910}}, cash of {{fact:75204319-6e22-4125-9aa8-a53584dec75d}} and revenue to plan of {{fact:a13213b6-1c64-4a30-8fb0-1b9ade487953}}, each matching the bank's calculation.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"Low-severity signals fired for falling headroom on the cash and revenue covenants. The more relevant signal concerns Minimum Unrestricted Cash. Its cushion has declined steadily from August to {{fact:8be6e746-dc43-4b96-aecc-08d235db6b5b}} in October. The cushion remains above the floor, but the trend warrants monitoring. Because revenue is running ahead of plan, the decline is not explained by sales. The facts available do not show whether spending or working capital is driving it, and a reviewer may wish to establish the cause. The other signal notes a marginal slip in Revenue to Plan headroom to {{fact:cb16809d-b762-499d-9bf6-cf6b3afbf507}}, which is close to flat. No work items are open.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
